entry.content:
add_train_journey: inputSchema  parameters: +input.season_type input.season_type enum: ["weekly", "monthly", "quarterly", "six_monthly", "annual", "flexi"] input.season_type description: Season tickets only: how long the season runs. The operator divides the season price into single journeys (for example annual 464, monthly 40, weekly 10, flexi 16) and pays a share of one journey. When left out, the result gives the percentage and the method but no amount. +for "season" the amount is a share of one journey value (see season_type);
check_train_delay: inputSchema  parameters: +For a season ticket, the price of the whole season. -"Season". +"Annual Season", "Monthly Season", "Flexi Season". +A season is valued per journey from its length; a season with no length gets no amount.
save_claim: inputSchema  parameters: +input.train.season_type input.train.season_type enum: ["weekly", "monthly", "quarterly", "six_monthly", "annual", "flexi"] input.train.season_type description: Season tickets only: how long the season runs. The operator divides the season price into single journeys (for example annual 464, monthly 40, weekly 10, flexi 16) and pays a share of one journey. When left out, the result gives the percentage and the method but no amount. +for "season" the amount is a share of one journey value (see season_type);
added get_claim_instructions
added scan_for_claims
